MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "The portable Samsung SSD fits my use of external storage while adding a convenient way to move files beyond my older WD desktop drive.",
    "The HDMI switch could help my Blu-ray player and Fire TV share a TV input, so it connects devices I already use. Alexa-compatible products also fit my recent Echo purchases."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "The Fire TV Stick and Echo Show 8 fit my interests, but I recently bought a Fire TV Stick 4K Max bundle and a Show 5 stand, so neither fills a clear gap now.",
    "The enterprise hard drive and internal SSD require capacity needs or computer compatibility I haven't established. The headphones, five short charging cables, and separate microphone also lack a clear purpose in my current setup."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "My Alexa purchases seem to have been taken as a reason to suggest more Alexa devices, even when I already have the same function covered.",
    "My history with storage and computer accessories seems to have been stretched into interest in almost any storage upgrade or peripheral, regardless of how I would use it."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "My recent Show 5 stand and my earlier remote replacement batteries suggest that supporting equipment I already own can be more useful to me than adding another main device.",
    "A practical next purchase needs a specific job and suitable connections. I'd check the HDMI switch's compatibility and the Blink bundle's installation requirements; neither usefulness nor compatibility follows just from being related to my existing devices."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The suggestions recognize my connected-home and computer interests, but miss the difference between filling a practical gap and duplicating equipment I already have."
}
